			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across all components\n\nSynchronize 14 Element submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Documentation & Changelogs:**\n- Grove: Add CHANGELOG, CODE_OF_CONDUCT, CONTRIBUTING, LICENSE for WASM extension sandbox\n- Maintain: Restructure CHANGELOG to quarter-based versioning (v2.1-v0.0)\n- Mist: Add comprehensive CHANGELOG following Keep a Changelog format\n- SideCar: Expand CHANGELOG with v2.1-v2.0 release history\n- Vine: Add CHANGELOG documenting v2.1-v1.1 protocol evolution\n\n**Dependency Updates:**\n- Common: Bump @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260415.1 → 4.20260416.2\n- Echo: Bump @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260416.2 → 4.20260417.1\n- Wind: Bump typescript 6.0.2 → 6.0.3\n\n**Features & Bug Fixes:**\n- Mountain: Fix Sky path resolution (Element/Sky/Target → Sky/Target), add dev-only cfg guards, implement FileSystem effects (Stat, CreateDirectory, Delete, Rename, Copy), add extension scanning instrumentation\n- Wind: Add 21 atomic service barrel exports for organized public API surface\n\nThis coordinated update ensures all components are synchronized with latest features, dependency updates, and documentation improvements.",
