			"Message": "chore(Maintain): Expand CHANGELOG to Keep a Changelog format\n\nUpdate Maintain/CHANGELOG.md from a minimal \"Initial version\" entry to a comprehensive changelog documenting all releases from v0.0.1 (2024 Q2) through v0.6.0 (2026 Q2).\n\nThe expanded changelog now includes: CI/CD pipeline establishment, GritQL infrastructure, Node.js sidecar support, build tool releases, guard disarm mechanism, and documentation updates - all following the Keep a Changelog format with proper semantic versioning and quarterly release cycle documentation.",
