			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across all components\n\nSynchronize 13 Element submodules to their latest commits with the following changes:\n\n**Documentation & Changelogs:**\n- Air: Populate CHANGELOG with complete version history v0.0-v0.3\n- Common: Add ProviderType enum variants (Task, Authentication, TreeView, SourceControl, DebugAdapter), convert to Keep a Changelog format\n- Echo: Expand CHANGELOG with comprehensive version history\n- Mountain: Split WindServiceHandlers/CocoonService into 39 atomic domain modules, add CHANGELOG\n- Output: Update CHANGELOG with v0.0-v0.5 history\n- Rest: Convert CHANGELOG to Keep a Changelog format\n- Sky: Document v0.0-v2.1 full changelog\n- Worker: Document complete changelog v0.0.1-v0.5.0\n\n**Dependency Updates:**\n- Common: Bump actions/cache, @cloudflare/workers-types\n- Echo: Bump wrangler, miniflare, @cloudflare/workers-types, cloudflare/wrangler-action\n- Grove: Bump actions/cache\n- Maintain: Bump actions/cache\n- Sky: Bump @xterm/*, astro, dotenv\n\n**Features & Refactoring:**\n- Mountain: Major IPC refactor into domain-specific modules (Command, Configuration, FileSystem, etc.)\n- Wind: Add 5 Tauri event subscriptions (fileChange, onDidChangeConfiguration, onTerminalData, onWillShutdown, onDidChangePhase)\n\nThis coordinated update ensures all components are synchronized with latest features, dependency updates, and documentation improvements.",
