			"Message": "fix(Project): Synchronize Cocoon and Mountain gRPC interface fixes\n\nCoordinate submodule updates to address bidirectional communication issues:\n\n1. **Cocoon**: Fix executeCommand request field name from `args` to `arguments` to match Mountain backend interface. Improve $acceptModelAdded handler to properly parse DocumentStateDTO: use URI.toString() for proper URI formatting, handle content as Lines array or direct string, and simplify content length calculation.\n\n2. **Mountain**: Fix registerCommand handler to properly lock CommandRegistry before insertion and use correct CommandHandler::Proxied structure with SideCarIdentifier/CommandIdentifier fields. Fix provider registration to use self.RunTime.Environment instead of self.Environment.\n\nThese changes ensure correct gRPC communication between Cocoon extension host and Mountain backend, proper command routing, and reliable document state synchronization.",
